  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>·</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Applying dot product with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math> on both sides of equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>·</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>as</mtext><mo> </mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>·</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>·</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Again, applying dot product with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math> on both sides of equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>·</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>48</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, using equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>·</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math></p><p>We know that, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>|</mo><mo> </mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>·</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>144</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>144</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>192</mn></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>·</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>48</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>192</mn></msqrt><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>48</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p>"
  }
